1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:01,392
The long-press menu.

2
00:00:01,432 --> 00:00:03,560
Hold the bar for the actions you use most.

3
00:00:04,300 --> 00:00:05,033
Hold the tab.

4
00:00:05,073 --> 00:00:08,067
Keep your finger on the
Dock until the ring closes.

5
00:00:08,107 --> 00:00:11,160
The menu opens beside it,
and stays when you let go.

6
00:00:11,500 --> 00:00:12,440
Tap an action.

7
00:00:12,480 --> 00:00:15,660
Each tile runs its action
and the menu closes.

8
00:00:15,700 --> 00:00:17,760
Here, the flashlight comes on.

9
00:00:18,100 --> 00:00:19,676
Hold and drag to move it.

10
00:00:19,716 --> 00:00:22,133
Hold, then move instead of letting go:

11
00:00:22,173 --> 00:00:25,560
the menu steps aside and
the bar follows your finger.

12
00:00:25,900 --> 00:00:26,821
Open its settings.

13
00:00:26,861 --> 00:00:30,238
In Gesture Volume, under Advanced
features, tap Long-press menu.

14
00:00:30,278 --> 00:00:32,160
The preview shows the menu as it is.

15
00:00:32,500 --> 00:00:33,861
Choose the actions.

16
00:00:33,901 --> 00:00:39,464
Open Items: remove what you never use,
and add what you want from Available.

17
00:00:39,504 --> 00:00:42,560
Here, Screenshot in place of Stop service.

18
00:00:42,900 --> 00:00:43,983
Pick a panel style.

19
00:00:44,023 --> 00:00:46,230
Under Colours, choose how it is drawn.

20
00:00:46,270 --> 00:00:50,960
Glass blurs what is behind it; the Deck
and the Quick slider use the same style.

21
00:00:51,300 --> 00:00:52,699
Choose how it opens.

22
00:00:52,739 --> 00:00:55,794
Under Animation, pick
an opening animation.

23
00:00:55,834 --> 00:00:58,960
The preview plays it
each time you pick one.

24
00:00:59,300 --> 00:01:00,946
Hold the tab again.

25
00:01:00,986 --> 00:01:05,560
Your actions, in the style
and animation you picked.

26
00:01:06,450 --> 00:01:10,910
Up next: Choose what each gesture does.
